  "benefits": "**Financial Assistance:**\n\n- Financial grant of up to ₹20,00,000/- per unit for the purchase of an insulated (reefer) vehicle.\n\n**Grant Limits:**\n\n- 40% of the unit cost for general category beneficiaries.\n- 60% of the unit cost for Scheduled Caste (SC) and women beneficiaries.\n\n> **Note**\n\n\n- Subsidy is applicable for one vehicle per beneficiary only.\n- Central assistance is released only after initiating fishery activity.\n- The applicant should agree that any losses in procurement, operation, or maintenance are their own responsibility, and not that of the Government of India or Haryana.\n\n<br>\n\n",
