  "deactivated_at": "2026-08-29T16:09:03.365268+00:00",
  "detailed_description": "The &quot;Insulated Vehicle&quot; scheme was launched by the Ministry Of Fisheries, Animal Husbandry &amp; Dairying, Government of India, under the umbrella scheme &quot;Pradhan Mantri Matsya Sampada Yojana&quot;. It aims to promote efficient and hygienic fish transportation systems. Under this scheme, a financial grant is provided to the beneficiaries for purchasing insulated (reefer) vehicles used in fish transportation. It seeks to minimize post-harvest losses, improve fish value chains, and enhance earnings of fish farmers by enabling cold-chain logistics.\n<br>\n\n",
  "eligibility": "\n1. The applicant should be a fish farmer.\n1. The applicant must possess a Family Identity Card (Parivar Pehchan Patra).\n1. The applicant must ensure that the fish transportation facility is maintained in working condition.\n1. The applicant must not have availed a grant for a similar insulated (reefer) vehicle earlier.\n\n<br>\n\n",
